*STEP, NAME=T60
*STATIC
** Symmetry on x = 0 and y = 0. u3 = 0 at the bottom centre, so u3 of CORNER is the warpage.
*BOUNDARY
SYM_X, 1, 1, 0.0
SYM_Y, 2, 2, 0.0
ORIGIN, 3, 3, 0.0
*TEMPERATURE
NALL, 60
*NODE PRINT, NSET=CORNER
U
*END STEP
